<!--
    Overlay on Playnite Default/Media.xaml.
    Icon set: Octicons 19.38.0 (MIT, info/LICENSE-octicons.txt), GitHub's icons, 16px variants on their own 16px grid
    (PrimerOcticonSize). Path data is the SVG source with explicit separators.

    One geometry per role Playnite's chrome needs (PrimerOcticon + role; the comment above them names the octicon),
    plus the select and menu indicators, drawn by PrimerOcticonTemplate in the inherited foreground.

    Playnite copies TextBlock icon resources (menus, sidebar items) by glyph, font and foreground only, so those
    stay icofont glyphs; this file only drops Playnite's colors (remove-game keeps fgColor-danger). Sidebar Library
    and Statistics get octicons through CustomControls/SidebarItem.xaml.
-->
